                <div class="sidearm-common-bio-full">
                    <span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="color:#000080;">Mason Schaller is entering his third season with the Harper Hawks in 2026 under Coach </span><strong><em><a href="https://www.harperhawks.net/staff-directory/dominic-milano/198"><span style="color:#000080;">Dom Milano</span></a> </em></strong><span style="color:#000080;">as the assistant to the head coach.</span></span><br>
 
<hr><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="color:#000080;"><strong>Asst. Coaching</strong><br>
<strong>2026: </strong>0-0-0<br>
<strong>2025 Record: </strong>27-24-0 (36-15 on the field - 9 forfeits due to clerical error)<br>
<strong>Team Transitioned to DII in 2025</strong><br>
<strong>2024 Record: </strong>13-39-0</span></span>

<hr><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="color:#000080;"><strong>Timeline</strong></span><span style="color:#000080;"><br>
-Asst. Coach (Baseball) at </span><em><strong><a href="https://www.harperhawks.net/sports/baseball"><span style="color:#000080;">Harper College</span></a></strong></em><span style="color:#000080;"> from 2024 - Current</span><br>
<span style="color:#000080;">-Head Coach (Youth Baseball) at </span><a href="https://www.nazarethacademy.com/s/157/new/index.aspx?pgid=356&amp;gid=1"><span style="color:#000080;"><b><i></i></b></span></a><strong><em><a href="https://www.slammersillinois.com/"><span style="color:#006400;">Slammers Training Academy</span></a></em></strong><a href="https://www.nazarethacademy.com/s/157/new/index.aspx?pgid=356&amp;gid=1"><span style="color:#000080;"><b><i></i></b></span></a><span style="color:#000080;"> from 2023 - Current</span><br>
<span style="color:#000080;">-Asst. Coach (Boy's Baseball) at </span><a href="https://www.nazarethacademy.com/s/157/new/index.aspx?pgid=356&amp;gid=1"><span style="color:#000080;"><b><i></i></b></span></a><strong><em><a href="https://www.d120.org/athletics/sports-spring/baseball/"><span style="color:#FF0000;">Mundelein High School</span></a></em></strong><a href="https://www.nazarethacademy.com/s/157/new/index.aspx?pgid=356&amp;gid=1"><span style="color:#000080;"><b><i></i></b></span></a><span style="color:#000080;"> from 2023 - Current</span><span style="color:#000080;"><br>
-Head Coach (Youth Baseball) at </span><a href="https://www.nazarethacademy.com/s/157/new/index.aspx?pgid=356&amp;gid=1"><span style="color:#000080;"><b><i></i></b></span></a><span style="color:#000080;">Regina Regals</span><a href="https://www.nazarethacademy.com/s/157/new/index.aspx?pgid=356&amp;gid=1"><span style="color:#000080;"><b><i></i></b></span></a><span style="color:#000080;"> from 2022 (1 season)</span><span style="color:#000080;"><br>
-Head Coach (Youth Baseball) at </span><a href="https://www.dreambigathletics.com/"><span style="color:#0000CD;"><b><i>Dream Big Athletics</i></b></span></a><span style="color:#000080;"> from 2021 (1 season)</span></span>

<hr><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="color:#000080;"><strong>Education</strong></span><span style="color:#000080;"></span><br>
<span style="color:#000080;"><strong>Bachelors Degree: </strong>Sports Management, Marketing, </span><strong><em><a href="https://mountmercymustangs.com/sports/bsb/2021-22/bios/schaller_mason_a3tf"><span style="color:#000080;">Mount Mercy University</span></a><span style="color:#000080;"> </span></em></strong><span style="color:#000080;">(2023)</span><span style="color:#000080;"><br>
<strong>Community College:</strong> </span><a href="https://tritonathletics.com/sports/baseball"><span style="color:#800000;"><strong><em>Triton</em></strong></span></a><span style="color:#000080;"> (2019-2020) / </span><strong><em><a href="https://gomcpanthers.com/sports/baseball"><span style="color:#FF8C00;">Morton</span></a><span style="color:#000080;"> </span></em></strong><span style="color:#000080;">(2021)</span><span style="color:#000080;"><br>
<strong>High School:</strong> </span><strong><em><a href="https://www.d120.org/athletics/sports-spring/baseball/"><span style="color:#FF0000;">Mundelein High School</span></a></em></strong><span style="color:#FF0000;"> </span><span style="color:#000080;">(2018)</span></span>

<hr><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="color:#000080;"><strong>Before Harper</strong></span><span style="color:#000080;"><br>
Schaller graduated from </span><strong><em><a href="https://www.d120.org/athletics/sports-spring/baseball/"><span style="color:#FF0000;">Mundelein</span></a></em></strong><span style="color:#000080;"> in 2018, where he played varsity baseball and made All-Conference. After high school, Schaller played three seasons of NJCAA baseball with one of them being the Covid season. His first two seasons were at </span><a href="https://tritonathletics.com/sports/baseball"><span style="color:#800000;"><strong><em>Triton</em></strong></span></a><span style="color:#000080;"> before transferring to </span><strong><em><a href="https://gomcpanthers.com/sports/baseball"><span style="color:#FF8C00;">Morton</span></a></em></strong><span style="color:#000080;">. He was All-Academic both years at </span><a href="https://tritonathletics.com/sports/baseball"><span style="color:#800000;"><strong><em>Triton</em></strong></span></a><span style="color:#000080;">. He then transferred to </span><strong><em><a href="https://mountmercymustangs.com/sports/bsb/2021-22/bios/schaller_mason_a3tf"><span style="color:#000080;">Mount Mercy</span></a></em></strong><span style="color:#000080;"> where he decided he wanted to go into coaching.</span><br>
<br>
<span style="color:#000080;">Schaller's coaching career started with </span><a href="https://www.dreambigathletics.com/"><span style="color:#0000CD;"><b><i>Dream Big Athletics</i></b></span></a><span style="color:#000080;"> coaching their 13u team. When Schaller moved to Iowa to play at </span><strong><em><a href="https://mountmercymustangs.com/sports/bsb/2021-22/bios/schaller_mason_a3tf"><span style="color:#000080;">Mount Mercy</span></a></em></strong><span style="color:#000080;">, he coached the Regina Regals, a 14u team. Schaller also helped work with the </span><strong><em><a href="https://www.d120.org/athletics/sports-spring/baseball/"><span style="color:#FF0000;">Mundelein</span></a><span style="color:#000080;"> </span></em></strong><span style="color:#000080;">catchers in the summer of 2023. He is currently coaching with the </span><strong><em><a href="https://www.slammersillinois.com/"><span style="color:#006400;">Slammers Training Academy</span></a></em></strong><span style="color:#000080;"> working with youth baseball players. He coached a 10u team in the fall of 2023 and is coaching a 12u team in the summer of 2024.</span><span style="color:#000080;"></span></span><br>
<br>
<br>
<br>
 
                </div>
            </article>

